  "notes": "{論理的|ろんりてき} is a na-adjective meaning logical, rational, or reasoned.\n\nFORMS:\n⟦{論理|ろんり}→論理：06026_ronri⟧ (logic) + {的|てき} (adjectival suffix)\n- Adverbial: {論理的|ろんりてき}に (logically)\n- Noun modifier: {論理的|ろんりてき}な + noun\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {論理的|ろんりてき}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{考|かんが}える→考える：00856_kangaeru⟧: to think logically\n- {論理的|ろんりてき}な⟦{説明|せつめい}→説明：01449_setsumei⟧: logical explanation\n- {論理的|ろんりてき}⟦{思考|しこう}→思考：10071_shikou⟧: logical thinking\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{感情的|かんじょうてき}→感情的：05678_kanjouteki⟧: emotional (opposite approach)\n- ⟦{直感的|ちょっかんてき}→直感的：05848_chokkanteki⟧: intuitive\n- ⟦{合理的|ごうりてき}→合理的：06199_gouriteki⟧: rational (similar meaning)",
